# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/mk/ca-gregorian.json.  dayPeriods am "претпл." (the tokenizer drops the
# dot).
претпл
am
# The spoken half of the day: CLDR 47 names morning1 (04:00-10:00) "наутро" and morning2
# (10:00-12:00) "претпладне", and both are adverbs in their own right -- en.wiktionary.org,
# Macedonian entries наутро ("in the morning") and претпладне ("before noon").
наутро
претпладне
